#: ui/search_dialog.py:46 ui/snippet_list.py:46
msgid "Weight"
msgstr "Gewichtung"

#. Translators: Search-results column showing the beginning of the
#. snippet text.
#. Translators: Snippet-list column showing the beginning of its content.
